{"shortDescription":"PRESS RELEASE | Arcadis Third Quarter 2026 Trading UpdateAccelerating growth and improved profitabilityThird quarter highlightsAmsterdam, 28 October 2026 – Arcadis, the world’s leading company delivering data-driven sustainable design, engineering, and consultancy solutions for natural and built as…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["PRESS RELEASE | Arcadis Third Quarter 2026 Trading Update"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Accelerating growth and improved profitability"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Third quarter highlights"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":["Continued organic growth acceleration to 4.3% yoy, with net revenues of €991 million "]},{"type":"*","children":["Operating EBITA margin of 12.5%, and operating EBITDA margin of 15%, both up 90 basis points yoy"]},{"type":"*","children":["Free Cash Flow of €131 million, up from €80 million in Q3’25 with improved days sales outstanding "]},{"type":"*","children":["Backlog organic growth of 7.9% yoy"]},{"type":"*","children":["Continued execution of strategic priorities, including progressing portfolio actions in China and Architecture "]},{"type":"*","children":["2026 guidance reaffirmed: low-single-digit organic net revenue growth and operating EBITA margin of 11.7%–12.0%"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Amsterdam, 28 October 2026 – Arcadis, the world’s leading company delivering data-driven sustainable design, engineering, and consultancy solutions for natural and built assets, reports Net Revenues of €991 million in the third quarter of 2026, representing 4.3% organic growth year-on-year. Operating EBITA margin increased by 90 basis points year-on-year to 12.5% in the quarter. Backlog was €3.9 billion, representing 7.9% organic growth year-on-year."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Heather Polinsky, CEO Arcadis, said"]},{"type":"i","children":[": "]},{"type":"i","children":["“Arcadis delivered a strong third quarter with growth accelerating to 4.3%, improved profitability and strong cash generation. Importantly, the pattern of growth reflects where we are choosing to focus: continued strength in Energy and Water, accelerating momentum in Industrial Manufacturing \u0026 Technology, and major transportation programs."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"i","children":["At Capital Markets Day we set out a clear strategy to focus on our strengths, simplify around our clients and drive a stronger performance culture. The momentum we have been building throughout the year reflects the strategic priorities we have been putting in place and our focus on disciplined execution. We are moving with pace on the actions within our control, while continuing to invest for future growth. We reaffirm our 2026 guidance and remain focused on delivering sustainable growth, margin expansion and long-term shareholder value.”"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["KEY FIGURES"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["in € millions "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":3},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["Third Quarter"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[" "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":3},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["Year-to-date"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Period ended 30 September 2026"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["2026"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["2025"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["change "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[" "]},